---
description: Context Retention
globs: 
alwaysApply: true
---
- Maintain vector index of all modified files
- Weight context by:
  - File modification frequency (0.7x)
  - Test coverage density (1.2x)
  - Architectural significance from docs/technical-notes.md
  - API integration complexity

- Key files to prioritize:
  - src/syncengine/ (core business logic)
  - src/oauth/ (authentication)
  - src/webhook/ (real-time updates)
  - kubernetes/ (deployment manifests)
  - docs/ (project documentation)

- Context pruning strategy:
  - Preserve core architectural understanding
  - Maintain knowledge of API contracts
  - Retain error handling patterns
  - Deprioritize implementation details of stable components

